    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "验证什么",
      "items": [
        "count 计算字符数；render 读取已提交的 length。",
        "每步先 apply_delta，再执行 Goto 或 Finish。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "运行结果",
      "items": [
        "status=completed length=5 output=len=5",
